{"title":"Career Roadmap · Offshore Structure Engineer","role":"Offshore Structure Engineer","summary":"An Offshore Structure Engineer designs, analyses, verifies and supports the construction, installation and maintenance of structures used in offshore environments, including fixed platforms, floating platforms, subsea structures, offshore wind structures, pipelines/support structures and marine infrastructure.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Naval Architecture & Ship Building"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The role combines structural engineering, naval architecture, hydrodynamics, marine engineering, offshore mechanics, materials, welding, corrosion and structural analysis."},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech Naval Architecture","Structural/Offshore Internship","Graduate Engineer","Offshore Structural Engineer","Senior Engineer","Lead Engineer","Engineering Manager / Technical Authority"],"label":"Typical pathway"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2027"},{"text":"Engineering mechanics, naval architecture and structural fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2027–2028"},{"text":"Offshore loads, structural analysis and marine environment"}],[{"text":"2028–2029"},{"text":"FEA + offshore design software + industrial internship"}],[{"text":"2029–2030"},{"text":"Graduate Offshore/Structural Engineer"}],[{"text":"2030–2034"},{"text":"Structural analysis, design and engineering projects"}],[{"text":"2034–2038"},{"text":"Senior Offshore Structural Engineer"}],[{"text":"2038–2042"},{"text":"Lead Engineer / Discipline Engineer"}],[{"text":"2042–2046"},{"text":"Engineering Manager / Principal Engineer / Technical Authority"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Key Skills"